# Custom recipe for SPIRV-Tools v2024.4 (cmake) -- part of the Mesa 25.3.6 CLC
# toolchain for the Pantheon desktop stack.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: Mesa 25.3.6 turns on with_clc because the iris (Intel)
# gallium driver is listed in with_driver_using_cl, and its meson.build does
# `dependency('SPIRV-Tools', version '>= 2024.1')`. SPIRV-Tools also backs the
# optional --spirv-tools-dis support inside SPIRV-LLVM-Translator. Built from
# the v2024.4 release tag, whose DEPS file pins SPIRV-Headers to
# 3f17b2af6784bfa2c5aa5dbb8e0e74a607dd8b3b.
#
# HOW IT FINDS SPIRV-Headers: the top-level CMakeLists never calls
# find_package(SPIRV-Headers). external/CMakeLists.txt only looks at the
# SPIRV-Headers_SOURCE_DIR cache variable (or a vendored external/spirv-headers
# checkout) and then only uses <dir>/include. We therefore point it at the
# INSTALLED headers tree /System/Index (which contains include/spirv after the
# SPIRV-Headers recipe runs). Because SPIRV-Headers_SOURCE_DIR is defined, the
# external dir is NOT added with add_subdirectory.
#
# pkg-config/CMake package: the build installs SPIRV-Tools.pc and
# SPIRV-Tools-shared.pc into lib/pkgconfig (version read from CHANGES, i.e.
# 2024.4.1) plus SPIRV-Tools{,Config,Targets}.cmake into lib/cmake/SPIRV-Tools,
# so Meson's dependency() resolves via pkg-config. Tests and the CLI
# executables are skipped (SPIRV_SKIP_EXECUTABLES implies SPIRV_SKIP_TESTS);
# only the libraries + headers + .pc are needed by Mesa. -Werror is disabled so
# the GCC 14 toolchain does not fail on new warnings. Shared libraries are
# installed with the plain SPIRV-Tools naming (SPIRV_TOOLS_BUILD_STATIC=OFF
# makes libSPIRV-Tools.so / -opt.so / -link.so, matching the .pc).
compile_version=017-GIT
url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Tools/archive/refs/tags/v2024.4.tar.gz"
file="SPIRV-Tools-v2024.4.tar.gz"
file_size=3200932
file_md5=a77776932cdd406ac299944cbc8e3395
dir='SPIRV-Tools-2024.4'
recipe_type=cmake
cmake_options=(
    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib
    -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON
    -DSPIRV_TOOLS_BUILD_STATIC=OFF
    -DSPIRV-Headers_SOURCE_DIR=/System/Index
    -DSPIRV_SKIP_TESTS=ON
    -DSPIRV_SKIP_EXECUTABLES=ON
    -DSPIRV_WERROR=OFF
)
